    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d546">

                <pb facs="0974" n="870" sameAs="frus:frus1943CairoTehran/pg870"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to Prime Minister
                        Churchill</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d546-f1"/>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">operational
                            priority</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-01-14">14 January 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Number 441, personal and secret, from the President for the Former Naval
                    Person.</p>
                <p>Your 536.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d546-f2"/> It is my understanding that in Teheran
                    U. J. was given a promise that <hi rendition="#small-caps">Overlord</hi> be
                    launched during May and supported by strongest practicable <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Anvil</hi> at about the same time and that he agreed
                    to plan for simultaneous Russian attack on Eastern front.<anchor n="3"
                        xml:id="d546-f3"/></p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d546-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d546-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to the United States Naval Attaché, London, via Navy channels.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d546-f2" n="2" xml:id="d546-f2-content">
